@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2


### 0. 登录获取 token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "替换为本地admin密码"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 准备说明
### 1. 本文件使用 admin 库存接口，仅适合本地联调测试，生产环境不能直接暴露。
### 2. 异步下单 POST /api/orders/async 会先执行 Redis Lua 预扣库存。
### 3. Redis 库存 key：ticket:stock:{ticketCategoryId}
### 4. request 去重 key：ticket:stock:deducted:{requestId}
### 5. 补偿 key：ticket:stock:compensated:{requestId}
### 6. 精确库存请同时看 MySQL 和 Redis：
###    SELECT ticket_category_id,total_stock,available_stock,locked_stock,sold_stock,version FROM ticket_stock WHERE ticket_category_id = 2;
###    redis-cli GET 'ticket:stock:2'


### 1. 预热全部库存到 Redis
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. 预热单个票档库存到 Redis
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/preload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. 查询 Redis 可售库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/redis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. 查询 Redis / MySQL 库存一致性
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/consistency
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. 获取异步下单 token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("idempotencyToken", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 6. 异步下单成功，预期 Redis 可售库存立即减少
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestId", response.body.data.requestId);
%}


### 7. 查询 Redis 可售库存，应比下单前少 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/redis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. 查询异步下单结果
### 可能看到 QUEUED / PROCESSING / SUCCESS / FAILED / COMPENSATED。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 9. 库存不足时异步下单失败
### 先重新获取 token。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("notEnoughToken", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 10. 使用超大 quantity 模拟 Redis 库存不足
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 999999,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{notEnoughToken}}"
}


### 11. 未预热库存时异步下单失败
### 先手动删除 Redis 库存 key：
### redis-cli DEL 'ticket:stock:2'
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("notPreheatedToken", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 12. 未预热时提交异步下单，预期返回“库存未预热，请先预热库存”
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{notPreheatedToken}}"
}
